│ Explanation of Changes:                                            │
│                                                                    │
│  • Added a check if uri.startswith('.') to identify local links.   │
│  • If the link is local, it constructs the full local path using   │
│    urllib.parse.urljoin.                                           │
│  • It then checks if the constructed local path starts with the    │
│    project path.                                                   │
